<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-GRIQUALAND WEST 215-4 AT LUNCH VS E.P..</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GRIQUALAND WEST 215-4 AT LUNCH VS E.P..</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griqualand West were 215 for four at lunch on the final day of their Supersport Series match against Eastern Province at St George's Park.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Eastern Province 476 and 185</p>
<p>Griqualand West 266 and 215 for four.</p>
</text>
